Add LazyOS to the ports WebKit's CMake knows.

WebKitCommon.cmake checks PORT against a fixed list before including
Source/cmake/Options${PORT}.cmake. The port's Options and Platform files are
laid into the tree by tools/webkit/port_tree.py (webkit/port/tree); this is the
one line of existing CMake that has to change to reach them.

--- a/Source/cmake/WebKitCommon.cmake
+++ b/Source/cmake/WebKitCommon.cmake
@@ -76,6 +76,7 @@
         GTK
         IOS
         JSCOnly
+        LazyOS
         Mac
         PlayStation
         WPE
